  "body": "Bordering Killarney Park on an 857 sqm (more or less) freehold section, this substantial brick-and-cedar residence enjoys lovely views of Lake Pupuke and an exceptional Takapuna lifestyle. Generous functional living spaces, established gardens and a versatile layout offers room for families to come together while enjoying their own space.\r\n\r\nNeutral interiors, expansive picture windows and large glass doors create a light, airy atmosphere, framing the lake views and spectacular sunsets. Designed for relaxed family living and entertaining, the home flows naturally between its inviting interiors and sunny outdoor spaces.\r\n\r\nA spacious open plan lounge features a corner window seat overlooking the garden, while the dining area, additional living area and modern kitchen open to decks and a lawn. Established landscaping provides a beautiful setting for entertaining, with plenty of room for children and pets. Two bedrooms on this level each open to decking and are complemented by a modern bathroom and separate powder room. A double internal-access garage, excellent storage and a laundry area add everyday practicality.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the generous master bedroom offers a peaceful retreat, complete with a walk-in wardrobe and private balcony overlooking the lawn and lake. A further double bedroom also enjoys lake views, while a quiet reading nook, bathroom and separate powder room complete this level.\r\n\r\nConnected to the main residence, a self-contained, single-level wing provides flexibility for extended family, guests or teenagers. With its own entrance, internal-access garage and off-street parking space, it includes two bedrooms, a bathroom and an open-plan kitchen, dining and living area. Connected yet independent, it is well suited to multi-generational living or larger households, or as an income source.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the convenience of nearby parks, the PumpHouse Theatre, excellent schools, cafés, restaurants, beaches and shops, with easy access to motorways and the city.\r\n\r\nWith its generous proportions, tranquil park-side setting and lovely lake views, this is a home offering an outstanding lifestyle in one of the North Shore’s most desirable locations.",
